# Keep the build context small and secrets out of the image.

# Secrets & local data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/
backups/
secrets.key
**/secrets.key

